{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "181f693ad57b7d08c6fb05dee05d8e0bf2db379ee7011ad17300588532508bb2", "ja": "悩みの種と、ナイショの恋バナ", "zh": "烦恼的由头，与秘密恋爱话题", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "462961ca2e8055644351f0569b13dc5721b1bef2f0816460ffaaf1f844222539", "ja": "夜、1人で外に向かう雪歩を見た琴葉は、\n心配して後を追う。一方部屋では、真美が\n莉緒に恋バナをせがんでいた。友達の話と\n言いつつ、なんだか身につまされる話を\nする莉緒。その頃、雪歩と琴葉は……。", "zh": "夜晚，琴叶看到雪步1个人往外走，\n放不下心的她便跟了上去。另一边在房间里，真美\n正缠着莉绪想听恋爱八卦。莉绪虽然说\n是朋友的事，讲的却总让人感同身受。\n就在这时，雪步和琴叶她们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1000_017kth", "source_sha256": "bf72960f6ba7cb149938381db4890461b630e636787ea5f564c1bcf97a906cea", "ja": "ふぅ。夕食、美味しかったな。\n部屋に戻ったら、今日のことメモしておかないと。", "zh": "呼……晚饭真好吃啊。\n回房间后，得把今天的事记下来才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "e1c1d936ebdb4c75967274b72ad58fc7ba7e3e1a212421bc25d51422ed13746b", "ja": "けど……失恋してもハジけられる女の子の気持ちは、\n全然つかめてない……このままで大丈夫かな……。", "zh": "可是……我完全无法理解失恋了也能嗨起来的女孩子是什么心情……这样下去真的没问题吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "e37d4029e5dd9d13e2e4374751fb5a54d676a717180d7907a81a5b9d71c9c218", "ja": "あれ、雪歩ちゃん？　あっ、外にいっちゃった……。\nこんな時間にどうしたんだろう？", "zh": "咦，雪步？啊，跑去外面了……\n这么晚了，是有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "f3cf446f03e67d0ec83b95398d0ec45871072dfc0cf5e0949a9566071ed008bb", "ja": "ひとりだと心配だし……。\n私も一緒に行ったほうがいいよね。", "zh": "一个人的话让人担心……  \n我也一起去比较好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1005_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1006_p", "source_sha256": "670a810f97fb2f3a731a8172bc9421989427e77aa3a873621276769df16f3f27", "ja": "（さて、明日のスケジュールを確認しないと……\n雪歩の様子も気になるし、部屋に行ってみるか）", "zh": "（好了，得确认一下明天的日程……也有点担心雪步的情况，去她房间看看吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "62de6973b58fa39e6a957a858e6e74625199c6c8b86f6a39cb68913e7b9f3a4a", "ja": "だからさー、ここはドドーン！ババーン！って\nカンジのトレーニングが必要だと思うわけだよ！", "zh": "所以说嘛，我觉得这里就需要那种轰——！砰——！感觉的训练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "109715d8eb3b1aa8869ead3f3c561eb9b321b89e12e15eaedb427da62d6d9c44", "ja": "私もそう思うけど……あんまり過激なのは、\n{$P$}くんが……。", "zh": "我也是这么想的，可是……太过激的话，{$P$}就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "efb15b8c9e61c812ed67b0147432aab99c94a34ac61f8f0f815c4f109f5dde33", "ja": "そこは、りおっちがいるから大丈夫っしょ！\n恋バナとか、兄ちゃんは頼りにならないっぽいし。", "zh": "有莉绪姐在嘛，这方面肯定没问题的啦！\n聊恋爱话题的话，哥哥好像不太靠得住。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "bb24e89cf57f3625e53b0a3bad790621295216194580f4b8bac51f74130e8a46", "ja": "でね、真美、サンコーのために\nりおっちに聞きたいコトがあるんだけど……。", "zh": "是这样，真美有件事想为了参考一下，问问莉绪姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1011_se", "source_sha256": "8e7f14ac05b8af6347c8336517efb85357319e29b9542e34b554f154c45397ba", "ja": "コンコン", "zh": "叩叩", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "197e91781db600b1f8bdc9935c0d3c59d17ad26b408ab76663da967058dc3e0a", "ja": "はいはーい！　あら、ウワサをすれば\n{$P$}くんじゃない。どうかしたの？", "zh": "好啦——！哎呀，说曹操曹操到，这不是{$P$}吗？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a12ea0132d92689949a81189773e59ab614e29261dc91578490a686a384b61f3", "ja": "ああ、明日の予定を確認しようと思ったんだけど……\nあれ、莉緒と真美だけか？", "zh": "啊，我本来想确认一下明天的安排……  \n咦，只有莉绪和真美吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "9caf674d057e124ee7a469f82702e378853a6b1b106a8dcbd855d2f0a87dd7b6", "ja": "ゆきぴょんはご飯の後、散歩に行くって言ってたよ。\n琴葉お姉ちゃんは、真美もわかんないけど……。", "zh": "雪步说吃完饭要去散步哦。\n至于琴叶姐姐，真美也不知道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8771aaf6f90826561661877e7c4b630d6f1491993459a239425fe64bab64a5a3", "ja": "そうだったのか、ありがとう。\n琴葉も一緒かもしれないな……。", "zh": "原来是这样，谢谢你。\n琴叶可能也在一起吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8f9732dd5f5e0d343b5d29ae7da5093c99357c05fba993a08c8c0d8c8c9e6138", "ja": "ちょっと様子を見てくるよ。何かあったら\n連絡するから、ふたりは部屋にいてくれ。それじゃ。", "zh": "我去看看情况。要是有什么事我会联系你们的，你们两个待在房间里。那就这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1017_se", "source_sha256": "11a3eff6ddcb2f9220c563a84912c256013cf61509de1542cfda57effe297faa", "ja": "ガチャ、バタン", "zh": "咔嚓、砰", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "07cbc21fae3b3db19d5a031fcefcd4293adc84d70cc7705ed2164439a4940a0b", "ja": "……ふう。\n兄ちゃんは行ったようだね……りおっち！", "zh": "……呼。\n看来老哥已经走了呢……莉绪姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "990f90db6edb53c19f99e96c448b0687dd9afb1bcc7c3e8572c608034bcb74f0", "ja": "え、な、なに？　どうしたの真美ちゃん、\nいつになく真剣だけど……。", "zh": "诶、怎、怎么了？真美，你这是怎么回事啊，\n难得这么认真……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "f85f903721262e1c3e8e59015403e807e05d12e052d452671d3dfbd800769514", "ja": "真美、りおっちに聞きたいコトがあるんだってば！\n恋バナして！", "zh": "真美有件事想问莉绪姐嘛！聊聊恋爱话题吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "e60ab9f1f0c142beeb5006090378c11b8fa5cde1d01eb3c6b6e0218b873624e0", "ja": "……ええ～っ！？　こ、恋バナ！？", "zh": "……诶诶～！？恋、恋爱八卦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1022_012mam", "source_sha256": "1b729163b9f459152ccf49e329d4d26c64cf82dbe5d326e340ce10f0e82ae731", "ja": "だって真美、りおっちと違って恋愛ケイケンとか\nそういうのないし！　ねえねえ、聞きたい聞きたいー！", "zh": "毕竟真美和莉绪不一样，完全没有恋爱经验什么的！快说快说，我想听我想听——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1023_046rio", "source_sha256": "f01c355662d597727ef631c8c4bdf04749503eda3e8c72d975265c190049481e", "ja": "そ、そう言われても……あ、じゃあ友達！\n私の、友達の話をしましょうか！", "zh": "可、可就算你这么说……啊，那就说朋友吧！来聊聊我朋友的事吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "de4602dfcbd91a1ade4c0436ee2fe41e7184b399859d5eb311d5d838ceb83e3d", "ja": "その友達には、前から、すこーしだけ……\n本当にすこしだけね？　気になってる男の子がいるの。", "zh": "那位朋友啊，从以前开始，就有那么一丁点……  \n真的只有一点点哦？她有个在意的男孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1025_012mam", "source_sha256": "46e21be8356082874a3984f00c30e62ddcc639411de5dae6b8e04058f7fc4b6c", "ja": "ふむふむ！　恋バナっぽい、いいツカミだね！\nそれで？", "zh": "嗯嗯！听起来是恋爱话题，开场不错嘛！\n然后呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1026_046rio", "source_sha256": "d532f1847650affea5c97bdf19135867922d4de42a48ebc3f059475de6b298ba", "ja": "その男の子とは年も近いし、なんでも相談できる\nフランクな関係で……まあ、友達みたいな感じね。", "zh": "那个男孩子和我年纪相仿，什么都可以找他商量，是那种很随意的关系……嗯，就像朋友一样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1027_046rio", "source_sha256": "5cee2e77d25bf3313a276c5c1581071cd1c307f0eebc9454031bd1ac050eea4f", "ja": "でもその男の子の周りには、\n他にも女の子がたくさんいて……。", "zh": "不过，那个男孩子身边还有很多其他女孩子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1028_046rio", "source_sha256": "5572bf0dd3bea4e1b65b2fdb0a81bdeaad2b5fa3106b9b131cfe6d016089c6dd", "ja": "「なんだか私に対する扱い、雑じゃない？」って\n感じるのが、少し不満なの……んん、不満らしいわ。", "zh": "“总觉得对我有点敷衍吧？”，\n她会这么觉得，有点不满呢……嗯哼，似乎是不满呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1029_012mam", "source_sha256": "9928130c81c7aad2f2541cac76806c1706e1ed70caf162a7cc711f8537ee408a", "ja": "ええ～？　でもでも、\nなんでも相談できる友達なんじゃないの？", "zh": "诶诶～？可是可是，不是能什么都商量的朋友吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1030_046rio", "source_sha256": "b061115838e4d246ccc1b58eaabbaec0fa3328ddb476053e4681c4cea760c062", "ja": "そうね。だから友達じゃなくて、もうすこし……\nひとりの女の子として見てほしい、ってことなのかも。", "zh": "是啊。所以不是想让你把我当朋友，而是希望你能再……把我当作一个女孩来看待，或许就是这个意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1031_012mam", "source_sha256": "3ad70415fec896d884edba344870f68b2b8040557ab8ca60bdc7987fd8ddf376", "ja": "ひとりの女の子として……はっ、それがラブ！？\nレンアイ感情ってヤツ！？", "zh": "作为一个女孩子……啊，难道这就是恋爱！？\n也就是所谓的恋爱感情！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1032_046rio", "source_sha256": "b3e75a7b509f0755e19810a72a07ee9986d82a018a8627fc4f0d79900b2ea1cf", "ja": "ええっ！？　ど、どうなのかしらね？\nまだちょっと気になるだけ、っていうか……？", "zh": "诶诶！？这、这我也说不准呀？\n还只是有点在意而已……该怎么说呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1033_012mam", "source_sha256": "fc003721bc9bb89032ff596503f0d18a8a014b2a42f8e7c5aa412b111e57709d", "ja": "でもでも、真美のクラスの子も言ってたよ。\n好きな男の子には、女の子として見られたいって！", "zh": "可是可是，真美班上的同学也这么说过哦。\n希望自己喜欢的男孩子能把自己当成女孩子看待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1034_046rio", "source_sha256": "03682e76655e6510eb81b5789ff535dddcfff3d1f08687ce98eedfe1fbf3ed79", "ja": "えっ。ちゅ、中学生と同じ……？\nそんなはずは……。", "zh": "诶？和、和初中生一样……？\n不、不会吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1035_012mam", "source_sha256": "587e691529bc600d2f3dc6aaa88dd83007df9a65ecb8762bb26c3a9b58338fbf", "ja": "へ？　なんでりおっち、慌ててるの？\n友達の話なんでしょ？", "zh": "咦？莉绪姐，你为什么这么慌张？说的是朋友的事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1036_046rio", "source_sha256": "1943912b79a0d29e562049cfe63d778fe6486224b5f3969ebd21eca9eb3ccd55", "ja": "そ、そう、そうね、友達の話！\nだから、ここまでしか知らないの！", "zh": "对、对，对啊，是朋友的事！\n所以我只知道这些！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1037_046rio", "source_sha256": "e897eaba4da36abbf4f5cb7a2ae4ea3572e7c790d8b881ea861fca21a7e575a9", "ja": "……そうだわ！　せっかくだから、\n今度は真美ちゃんの話にしましょ！", "zh": "……对了！难得有这个机会，\n这次聊聊真美的事吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1038_012mam", "source_sha256": "05a6f19b053a2142259c314780b789287c82fce282589a7d3fa4e8b056940c1b", "ja": "ええっ！？　真美？", "zh": "咦！？真美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1039_046rio", "source_sha256": "502cf1965171aac24a6c37fb0941f542fb2f5cf5ae0ca23c3682f8e9431dd75e", "ja": "最近の中学生の恋愛事情、気になるじゃない♪\nほらほら、お姉さんにも教えて～？", "zh": "最近中学生的恋爱情况，好奇嘛♪\n来来来，也跟姐姐说说嘛～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1040_012mam", "source_sha256": "3fb4e6a61bce2e73cc26a1e6164c0e2a5c4bb97649f42d8d15ef7674f32da684", "ja": "ええと、真美は……えーとえーと……\nうあうあ、だから真美、よくわかんないんだってば～！", "zh": "那个，真美……呃，呃……呜哇呜哇，真美都说了，真的不太明白嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1041_012mam", "source_sha256": "e010ae3a33dd9840401079c3cff9ceb09a635c5a66b91823bb4421bbe625cf9a", "ja": "あっ、それより兄ちゃんたち遅くない？\nなんか心配だし、探しに行こうよ！", "zh": "啊，对了，哥哥他们是不是太晚了？\n总觉得有点担心，我们去找找他们吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1042_012mam", "source_sha256": "7f46f23909283e47adb25692f03714c1f149aa5799d2354defaaab0a3ff830c4", "ja": "真美、先に海に行くから！　おーいゆきぴょん、\n琴葉お姉ちゃんー、どこにいるのさー！", "zh": "真美先去海边啦！喂——雪步，琴叶姐姐——你们在哪儿呀——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1043_046rio", "source_sha256": "ce000b68243b5b84cc528b4b3909253a12b84df585a2bac4afc97e79f93eead9", "ja": "あっ、真美ちゃん！？\nんもう、逃げ足が早いんだから。", "zh": "啊，真美！？\n真是的，跑得可真快。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_03_1044_046rio", "source_sha256": "c86587cd52d34c09685404f4b6ba6c77b09802bc9c2890eab2030101900c8d36", "ja": "でも、確かにみんな遅いわね。\n……真美ちゃん待って、私も行くからーっ！", "zh": "不过，大家确实都太慢了呢。\n……真美，等等我，我也要去——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
